## Interpretation and limits

Saved numerical evidence does not certify physical calibration. Publication is
final-only; retained RAM has no crash-recovery guarantee. NULL, absence and
nonfinite values remain distinct. See each episode's outcome and first failure.

@EPISODES@

## Field and coordinate coverage

Use field_catalog and coordinate_catalog for recorded source identities,
measurements, phases, units, validity and optional presence semantics.
